# ============================================================
# Profile D — 2x RTX 5090, tensor split
# STATUS: EXPERIMENTAL / UNTESTED
# ============================================================
# Every value below is a STARTING POINT, not a validated optimum.
# Nothing in this file has been benchmarked on real hardware yet.
# Fill in results/ before changing "UNTESTED" to a measured claim.
# Do NOT make this a default. Requires: Flash Attention on, NCCL built in
# (WITH_NCCL=1), and NON-quantized KV — which is expensive for long context.
# Consumer 5090s have no NVLink; if scripts/topology.sh reports P2P
# unavailable, cross-GPU reduction likely dominates and this will lose to
# Profile A. Run topology.sh BEFORE spending time here.
. "$(dirname "${BASH_SOURCE[0]}")/_base.env"
GPUS=0,1
PORT=9000
# F16 KV is forced: tensor split does not support quantized KV.
KV_K=f16
KV_V=f16
# Context reduced from 262144 because F16 KV costs ~4x q4_0 per token.
# The right value here must be found empirically, not assumed.
CTX=65536
TENSOR_SPLIT=1,1
